# [SCONE](../wg/scone.html)

## Summary

The SCONE Working Group met at IETF 127 to review progress on its core working group documents, evaluate candidate extensions, and discuss working group closure plans. The SCONE protocol draft is currently under IESG review pending resolution of a Discuss point linked to the manageability document. The working group reviewed `draft-ietf-scone-applicability-manageability-03` and agreed to issue a Working Group Last Call (WGLC) once version `-04` is published. 

The working group also evaluated four individual proposals: SCONE-ECHO, SCONE applicability for IEEE 802.11 access networks, qlog for SCONE, and SCONE-based rate advice for RoCEv2 networks. The consensus of the working group was not to adopt these items or recharter, but rather to focus on finalizing the active working group documents and prepare for working group shutdown.

